{"id":"a09d0af953c6995e","group":"58","path":"58/batch01/58-df-zfc-quotient-poset.md","title":"ZFC Quotient Poset","display":"df-zfc-quotient-poset — ZFC Quotient Poset","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-quotient-poset","aliases":["58-df-zfc-quotient-poset"],"display":"df-zfc-quotient-poset — ZFC Quotient Poset","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch15/58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-quotient-poset"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-quotient-poset</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-quotient-poset — ZFC Quotient Poset"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b5833df5ef175153\" href=\"?note=b5833df5ef175153\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset.md\">../batch15/58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},1_{\\mathbb P},G,Q\\in V\">\\(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},1_{\\mathbb P},G,Q\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingPoset}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingPoset}_S\\)</span> (forcing-preorder predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b5833df5ef175153\" href=\"?note=b5833df5ef175153\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset.md\">../batch15/58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P/G\">\\(P/G\\)</span> (carrier of conditions compatible with every member of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_G\">\\(\\leq_G\\)</span> (the forcing order restricted to <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P/G\">\\(P/G\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{QuotientPoset}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{QuotientPoset}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}quotient\\text{-}poset}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{QuotientPoset}_S(Q,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},1_{\\mathbb P},G)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingPoset}_S\n(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},1_{\\mathbb P})\n\\land G\\subseteq\\mathbb P\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists P_G,\\leq_G\\in V\\;\\Biggl[\nP_G=\\Bigl\\{p\\in\\mathbb P:\n\\forall q\\in G\\;\\exists r\\in\\mathbb P\\;\n\\bigl(\\langle r,p\\rangle\\in\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\n\\land\\langle r,q\\rangle\\in\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\bigr)\\Bigr\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{34mm}\\land\n\\leq_G=\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\cap(P_G\\times P_G)\n\\land Q=\\langle P_G,\\leq_G\\rangle\n\\Biggr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}quotient\\text{-}poset}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{QuotientPoset}_S(Q,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},1_{\\mathbb P},G)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingPoset}_S\n(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},1_{\\mathbb P})\n\\land G\\subseteq\\mathbb P\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists P_G,\\leq_G\\in V\\;\\Biggl[\nP_G=\\Bigl\\{p\\in\\mathbb P:\n\\forall q\\in G\\;\\exists r\\in\\mathbb P\\;\n\\bigl(\\langle r,p\\rangle\\in\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\n\\land\\langle r,q\\rangle\\in\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\bigr)\\Bigr\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{34mm}\\land\n\\leq_G=\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\cap(P_G\\times P_G)\n\\land Q=\\langle P_G,\\leq_G\\rangle\n\\Biggr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span> is the ordered forcing datum, not merely its carrier.</li>\n<li>Compatibility is expanded with a common stronger condition, so the construction works for the preorder convention used by the forcing-poset dependency.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"b5833df5ef175153","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"b5833df5ef175153","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingPoset}_S$ (forcing-preorder predicate, see [[../batch15/58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},1_{\\mathbb P},G,Q\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingPoset}_S","display":false},{"tex":"P/G","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"\\leq_G","display":false},{"tex":"P/G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{QuotientPoset}_S\\subseteq V^5","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}quotient\\text{-}poset}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{QuotientPoset}_S(Q,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},1_{\\mathbb P},G)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingPoset}_S\n(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},1_{\\mathbb P})\n\\land G\\subseteq\\mathbb P\\\\\n&\\land\\exists P_G,\\leq_G\\in V\\;\\Biggl[\nP_G=\\Bigl\\{p\\in\\mathbb P:\n\\forall q\\in G\\;\\exists r\\in\\mathbb P\\;\n\\bigl(\\langle r,p\\rangle\\in\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\n\\land\\langle r,q\\rangle\\in\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\bigr)\\Bigr\\}\\\\\n&\\hspace{34mm}\\land\n\\leq_G=\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\cap(P_G\\times P_G)\n\\land Q=\\langle P_G,\\leq_G\\rangle\n\\Biggr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"Q","display":false}],"bytes":1572,"backlinks":[{"id":"b868439bb717acf7","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3214","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-zfc-quotient-poset.md|58-df-zfc-quotient-poset]]（batch01）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","b5833df5ef175153"]}